                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4 Permanent Disarmament Commission/7:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American Delegate
                        (Wilson)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-11-02T15:00:00-05:00">November 2, 1932—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>229. Your 428, November 2, noon. We defer to your judgment, and approve your
                    suggested method of handling the problem.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carr</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
